WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.170
Close the book and look at your notebook.

2
00:00:02.170 --> 00:00:03.680
Five numbered notes —

3
00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:06.620
all your own thinking, in your own handwriting.

4
00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:09.220
That's your training notes, and it's also your guide

5
00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:10.340
for everything left.

6
00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:13.370
On the next two screens, type up those notes.

7
00:00:13.790 --> 00:00:17.810
Don't polish them, don't rewrite them — just transcribe.

8
00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:21.030
The notes lead; the keyboard follows.
